# English: the game's text, and the fallback for every other language.
# Keys are symbolic (see godot/scripts/L.cs); placeholders are {0}, {1}, ... in order.
# A new language: copy this file to <code>.po, set Language, translate each msgstr, and add it to
# internationalization/locale/translations in project.godot. Leave a msgstr out to fall back to English.
